unscii-8
--------

tools/una/tether/stub/font8x8.h holds the glyphs of unscii-8 by Viznut, which
is in the public domain, converted by tools/una/tether/stub/gen_font.py from
LVGL's lv_font_unscii_8.c (third_party/lvgl, MIT licence).


Bosch Sensortec SensorAPI
-------------------------

drivers/imu/bmi270/bmi270_config.c is the configuration file of the BMI270,
"bmi270_config_file" of Bosch Sensortec's BMI270 SensorAPI (bmi270.c, v2.86.1),
unchanged, which the driver loads into the part. The compensation of the
BMM350's readings in drivers/imu/bmm350/bmm350_regs.h is ported from its
BMM350 SensorAPI (bmm350.c, v1.4.0): the layout of the calibration in the
part's OTP, its scaling and the formulas. Both are under this licence:

